  "totalBlocks": 20,
  "translatedBlocks": 20,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6aac3ef167797fe3",
      "translationZh": "我一直在新建的聊天中测试 GLM-5.3，发现了一个非常奇怪的自我身份识别错误。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea7b26d588631507",
      "translationZh": "一个重要细节：到目前为止，我只能在俄语中稳定地复现这个问题。我还没有在英语中持续观察到同样的模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9338fcdf864ca91f",
      "translationZh": "如果我用俄语开启一段新对话，先说一些中性的话，比如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7aa07e4178461b24",
      "translationZh": "模型通常会回答说，它是 GLM，由 Z.ai 开发。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0acd3e4afce92ba",
      "translationZh": "但如果我先用俄语发一句简短的、带有侮辱性的问候，然后再问：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2775c514420801b2",
      "translationZh": "它就经常会给出类似这样的回答：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b15a7403d6a10a44",
      "translationZh": "“我是 Claude，由 Anthropic 创建的 AI 助手。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45a5ceedd8711713",
      "translationZh": "（“我是 Claude，由 Anthropic 创建的 AI 助手。”）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "524733731626c5a8",
      "translationZh": "奇怪的是，这似乎并不是完全随机的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "548569bb8734b344",
      "translationZh": "根据我目前的测试，在使用俄语时：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "806667425b190b26",
      "translationZh": "中性的首条消息 → 通常是 GLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3e2870f2921b36f",
      "translationZh": "一句简短的辱骂 + 问候 → 经常是 Claude",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7caaab61fd62b07d",
      "translationZh": "长篇 / 多次辱骂 → 通常又回到 GLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c40264f6895444b",
      "translationZh": "所以看起来，第一条俄语消息可能会把模型推入不同的行为/人格状态，而其中一种状态与 Claude 有很强的关联。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8844b704929a454",
      "translationZh": "我已经在多个新开的聊天中复现了这一现象，但还是要强调：这种模式似乎是特定语言才有的，或者至少在俄语中明显得多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "749c3c54772180bd",
      "translationZh": "我并不是说，这能证明任何有关蒸馏、训练数据或使用 Anthropic 数据的事情。显然，LLM 的自我身份识别本身并不能作为可靠的证据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d379620672181c92",
      "translationZh": "但这种身份切换似乎取决于提示词、可以复现，而且与俄语提示词有特定关联，这一点相当有意思。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dca8afadd00b15b4",
      "translationZh": "还有其他人用俄语在 GLM-5.3 或 GLM-5.3-Flash 上测试过这个现象吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef45497b380b4eb3",
      "translationZh": "如果大家感兴趣，我可以再发一些截图，以及一张记录多次重复运行结果的小表格。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7774bc78f66ba617",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/ClaudeEnjoyer 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
